<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Zanaki Titus</book>
  <para style="h">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Enyaarubha ya Pauro ku Tito</para>
  <para style="mt2">Enyaarubha ya Pauro ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tito</para>
  <para style="imt">Obhutaangiro</para>
  <para style="ip">Eriingʼaara rino, rikaamirwe no omweega Pauro. Hano yaari akyaari kukaama eriingʼaara rino, Pauro yaari arakora emirimo gya Taatabhugya hamwe na Tito mukigiinga kya Kirete. Kyaamwe akarwa eyo, akamara siku suuhu, akamukaamira Tito eriingʼaara rino kwo obhuswaagyo bhwoosi iguru yo okwiimeererera abhiikirirya Kirete eyo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Munyaarubha yino, Pauro akamuha Tito emirimo gyo okusora abhakaruka bhe ekanisa. Kweeki akamutoongera okubhatugika abhiikirirya bha Kirete, kwo okubha bhaari bharimu abheegya bho orurimi. Pauro aramutoongera Tito na kyeego okukaangata amahizo mukanisa, abhakaruka, abhamura na abhabhagati. Mubhuteero aramuhiitya Tito kubha Abhakrisito bhoosi bhiikare kwo omureembe no obhusaambaaruku, na bhatabha bhaatu bho okurwaana no okutwaanikana amahizo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Obhukeerya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1"/>Enyaarubha yino nikaamiri enye Pauro, omugya wa Taatabhugya, kweeki omweega wa Yeesu Krisito. Nitumirwe kwiiguru yo okweerekeererya abhaatu bhano bhasorirwe na Taatabhugya, okubha bhasakiribhwe okumenya obhuheene iguru wa Yeesu Krisito. Obhuheene bhuyo bhurabhakaangatya okumuseengera Taatabhugya, <verse eid="TIT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2"/>no okubhaha obhwiisige bhwo obhuhoru bhwa kirakeego. Taatabhugya akaragirira obhuhoru bhuyo, hano yaari akyaari kuteema ekyaaro, ewe atakunagya kugaamba orurimi. <verse eid="TIT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3"/>Bhoono, eriibhaga rino rikungʼarira niryo Taatabhugya Omutuurya weetu yeerekirye kubhweero Amangʼana gaaye Amazomu gayo, na aswaagirye nirwaaze amangʼana gayo. <verse eid="TIT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4"/>Ndakukaamira awe Tito, omwaana waane we eheene mubhwiikirirya bhuno tukwiisanginia hamwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Orubhaango no omureembe okurwa ku Taatabhugya Taata na ku Krisito Yeesu Omutuurya weetu, bhibhe naawe.<verse eid="TIT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emirimo gya Tito mukigiinga kya Kirete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5"/>Hano narwiiri Kirete eyo, nikakutiga awe okubha otuure kisi amangʼana agaandi gano gasaagiri, hamwe no okusora abhakaruka bhe ekanisa mumigye gyoosi, kyeego nakuswaagirye.<verse eid="TIT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6"/>Omukaruka wowoosi we ekanisa, areenderwa kubha muutu wuno atana amasoro gogoosi. Areenderwa abhe omuheene kumukari waaye,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abhe omuheene kumukari waaye</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, ku Kiyunaani ni </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">abhe akweeriri mukari wumwe.</char></note> abhaana bhaaye bhabhe abhiikirirya, bhatabha abhazabhuri kisya bhano bhatakumwiigwa. <verse eid="TIT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7"/>Omukaangati we ekanisa wuyo, areenderwa kubha muutu wuno atana amasoro gogoosi, kwo okubha ni mwiimeerereri we emirimo gya Taatabhugya. Atabha muutu muregenu, omururu, omunywi omuraara, omurwaani, kweeki atabha ne enaamba embiihu yo okubhona eziimbirya. <verse eid="TIT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8"/>Nawe abhe omuginihya, aseegiri amazomu, abhe na kusuuhu, omuheene, muhoreeru, na wuno akwiibhaaha. <verse eid="TIT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9"/>Abhe aragwaata bhuzomu amangʼana go obhuheene iguru wa Yeesu Krisito, kyeego akeegibhwa. Hayo niho, akunagya okugumirya abhaatu kumeegyo go obhuheene, no okubheerekeererya bhano bhakwaanga ameegyo gayo.<verse eid="TIT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10"/>Nirakubhuurira ego, kwo okubha Kirete hayo bhaari bhariho abhaatu bhaaru bhano bhatakwiigwa, bharabhuga amangʼana gano gatana bhweera, kweeki ni bhakaangirirya, kiindi abhamwe bhano bharwiiri munyaangi ya Abhayahudi. Abhaatu bhayo bharekibhwe okweegya, <verse eid="TIT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11"/>kwo okubha bharabhurya abhaatu muziinyuumba nzaru. Bhareegya amangʼana gano gatakweenderwa, okubha bhabhone eziimbirya kuteemo embiihu. <verse eid="TIT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12"/>Ekare haari no omurooti wumwe Mukirete, wo waabhu abheene, wuno yabhugiri, “Abhakirete ni bhabheehi eziisiku zoosi, ni kye ebhityeenyi ebhibhi, bhasoohu na abhatobhu!” <verse eid="TIT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13"/>Obhugaambi bhuyo ni bhwe eheene. Kweego, obhe orabharekya bhukongʼu abhaatu bhayo, okubha bhagwaate ameegyo go obhuheene. <verse eid="TIT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14"/>Bhatige okwiitegeerera amagano ge Ekiyahudi gano gatana obhweera, no obhuswaagyo bhwa abhaatu bhano bhatigiri obhuheene.<verse eid="TIT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15"/>Kubhaatu bhe eziikoro nzomu embere wa Taatabhugya, ebhigiro bhyoosi bhyeeriibhwe. Nawe, kubhaatu makire na bhano bhatari abhiikirirya, ebhigiro bhyoosi ni makire, kwo okubha amiiseego gaabhu ne emitima gyaabhu, giizwiiri amakire. <verse eid="TIT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16"/>Bharabhuga abheene bharamumenya Taatabhugya, nawe amahokya gaabhu gareerekya kubha bharamwaanga. Bhayo nibho abhazabhuri, bhatakungʼarira kwe engʼana yoyoosi enzomu.<verse eid="TIT 1:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ameegyo go obhuheene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1"/>Nawe awe Tito, obhe oreegya abhaatu kuriingʼaana na ameegyo go obhuheene. <verse eid="TIT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2"/>Obhabhuurire abhakaruka bhabhe na kusuuhu, bho obhusuuku na bhano bhakwiibhaaha. Kweeki, bhabhe no obhwiikirirya bhwe eheene, bhabhe no obhuseegi no obhwiikongʼeererya.<verse eid="TIT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3"/>Egoego na abhakiikuru nabho, obhabhuurire kubha bhabhe ne eteemwa yino ekumuguungya Taatabhugya. Bhatabha abhamoonyi, bhatabha abhanywi abharaara, nawe bhareenderwa okweegya ameegyo ge esiira enzomu, <verse eid="TIT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4"/>okubha bhabhe bharabheegya abhaakya kubhaseega abhasubhe bhaabhu na abhaana bhaabhu. <verse eid="TIT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5"/>Kweeki, bhabhe bharabheegya kubha na kusuuhu, bhabhe ne ekoro nzomu, bhakore bhuzomu emirimo muziinyuumba zyaabhu, bhabhe bhazomu na bhano bhakusuuka abhasubhe bhaabhu. Obhabhuurire bhakore ego, okubha engʼana ya Taatabhugya etazeerwa.<verse eid="TIT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6"/>Egoego na abhamura, obharekye bhabhe na kusuuhu. <verse eid="TIT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7"/>Naawe, mumangʼana goosi, obhe ekireengyo kyo okweegwa kweebho kwo okukora amazomu. Obhe omuheene no omugumiru mumeegyo gaazo. <verse eid="TIT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8"/>Ameegyo gaazo gabhe ge eheene na gatabha na amasoro kubhaatu. Naabhe omuutu areenda kugahakana, arasuukibhwa, kwo okubha atakubha ne engʼana yo okutugaamba bhubhi.<verse eid="TIT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9"/>Kweeki abhagya nabho, obhabhuurire kubha bhabhasuuke abhakuru bhaabhu mugoosi, bhabhasaambaarukye, na bhatahakana nabho. <verse eid="TIT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10"/>Bhatabha bhiibhi, nawe bhabhe abhaheene, okubha emirimo gyaabhu gyoosi, gikore abhaatu bharutwe na ameegyo ga Taatabhugya Omutuurya weetu.<verse eid="TIT 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11"/>Obhe oreegya amangʼana gayo, kwo okubha Taatabhugya abheerekirye orubhaango rwaaye, kwo okureeta obhutuurya kubhaatu bhoosi. <verse eid="TIT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12"/>Orubhaango ruyo, ruratweegya okwaanga obhubhi ne enaamba ye ekyaaro. Kweego, hano tukyaari mukyaaro kino, tubhe na kusuuhu, bhe eheene, na abhaatu bhano bhakwiikara obhwiikari bhwo okumuseengera Taatabhugya. <verse eid="TIT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13"/>Twiikare ego, eriibhaga rino tukwiisigira orusiku rwo orubhaango, hano Yeesu Krisito araakyoore arorekane mubhuguungo bhwaaye. Ewe niwe Taatabhugya weetu Omukuru no Omutuurya weetu. <verse eid="TIT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14"/>Akiiruusya kwiiguru weetu, okubha atutuurye okurwa mubhibhi bhyoosi. Akeenda okutweerya, okubha tubhe abhaatu bhaaye bhe eheene, bhano bhakwiiruusya okukora amazomu.<verse eid="TIT 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15"/>Ambe bhoono, obhe oreegya amangʼana gayo goosi. Oheerwe obhuturo bhwoosi bhwo okugumirya no okurekya abhaatu. Kweego, otazeerwa na muutu wowoosi.<verse eid="TIT 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Okukora amazomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1"/>Obhe orabhahiitya abhaatu kubha, bhabhe bharasuuka no okwiigwa abhakaangati na bho obhunagya. Bhabhe bhiibhanwiiri okukora amangʼana goosi amazomu. <verse eid="TIT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2"/>Obhabhuurire bhatatuka muutu wowoosi, bhatabha bhatiindi, bhabhe bhanyoohu na abhasuuku kubhaatu bhoosi.<verse eid="TIT 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3"/>Naabhe etwe abheene twaari bhageege na tutaari tumenyiri amangʼana ga Taatabhugya, abhaangi na tukaangiririibhwe, eno tubheeri abhagya bhe eziinaamba mbiihu zya tuubho nzaru. Obhwiikari bhweetu bhwaari bhubhi no omugono. Abhaatu bhaari bharatubhiihirirya, neetwe twaari turabhabhiihirirya. <verse eid="TIT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4"/>Nawe Taatabhugya, Omutuurya weetu, akatweerekya obhuzomu no obhuseegi bhwaaye, akatutuurya. <verse eid="TIT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5"/>Atatutuurirye kwe ekigirirye kya amahokya geetu amazomu, nawe kwe ekigirirye kye ebhigoongi bhyaaye. Atweerirye ebhibhi bhyeetu, kuyo nikwo okwiibhurwa bhuhya. Kweeki atuheeri obhwiikari bhuhya kwo okuhitira Ekoro Muhoreeru.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ekoro Muhoreeru</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora amangʼana gano mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</char></note> <verse eid="TIT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6"/>Taatabhugya akatwiikirya Ekoro Muhoreeru, kwo okuhitira Yeesu Krisito Omutuurya weetu. <verse eid="TIT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7"/>Akakora ego, no okutubhara kubha bhe eheene kwe enzira yo orubhaango rwaaye, okubha tubhone okugabha obhuhoru bhwa kirakeego, kyeego tukwiisiga.<verse eid="TIT 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8"/>Amangʼana gayo ni ge eheene. Ndeenda awe ogakumiirirye, okubha bhoosi bhano bhamwiikiriirye Taatabhugya, bhagagwaatirire no okubha no omukya kukora amazomu. Amangʼana gayo ni mazomu, kweeki gano obhweera kubhaatu bhoosi. <verse eid="TIT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9"/>Nawe, wiiriihe no obhuhakani bhwe ekigeege, obhuzaabhi bhwa amariina ga bhazaazi, eriiyoge no obhuhakani iguru we emigiro gya Musa. Gayo goosi gatana bhweera bhwobhwoosi. <verse eid="TIT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10"/>Omuutu wuno akutwaanikania abhaatu, omurekye orugeendo rwo okutaanga kisya rwa kabhiri. Hano okubhona atakwiigwa, tigana neewe. <verse eid="TIT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11"/>Omenyiri kubha omuutu kya wuyo atigiri obhuheene, ni muutu wuno akukora ebhibhi, yiitiniiri ekiina omweene.<verse eid="TIT 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amangʼana go obhuteero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12"/>Ndabhatuma Aritema kasi Tikiko kwaawe. Hano araahike owaazo, okore omukya ombone mumugye gwa Nikapori. Niendiri kwiikara eyo eriibhaga rye embeho. <verse eid="TIT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13"/>Okore omukya kumusakirya Zena, omukaari we emigiro, na Apooro. Obhahe bhyoosi bhyo okubhasakirya munzira, bhatasuuhirwa kigiro. <verse eid="TIT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14"/>Abhiikirirya abharikyeetu nabho, bheege okukora amazomu kwo omukya, okubha bhasakirye bhano bhakweenda obhweendi bhwe eheene. Bharaakore ego, obhwiikari bhwaabhu bhurabha no obhweera.<verse eid="TIT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15"/>Abhaatu bhoosi bhano bhari hamwe neenye, bharakukeerya. Bhoono naawe woosi, obhakeerye abhaseegwa bheetu mubhwiikirirya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Orubhaango rwa Taatabhugya rubhe hamwe neemwe mwoosi.<verse eid="TIT 3:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3"/>
</usx>
